# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Arclight .gitignore
# Rule of thumb: commit source and inputs, never build output or
# per-user IDE state. Third-party binaries we *depend on* (e.g.
# WinPixEventRuntime .lib/.dll) are kept, so we never blanket-ignore
# *.lib / *.dll / bin/.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Our build output (OutDir/IntDir in the .vcxproj) ---
Source/build/
/build/
/out/

# --- Visual Studio ---
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.aps
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
ipch/
*.ipch
*.tlog
*.ilk
*.idb
*.iobj
*.ipdb
*.exp

# DirectXTex builds its own .lib into this folder
Source/3rdParty/DirectXTex/Bin/

# --- CMake (for when we move to CMake for Windows + Mac) ---
CMakeUserPresets.json
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake-build-*/

# --- Xcode / macOS ---
DerivedData/
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
.DS_Store

# --- Editors / tools ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# --- Runtime output ---
*.log
imgui.ini
